github.com/users/sydist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-19T18:53:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T18:53:53Z","body":"Hi everyone,\r\n\r\nI wanted to check back in on this PR to see if we can move forward or if there are any remaining concerns about the signal behavior.\r\n\r\nTo recap, disabled items will now emit item_selected and item_clicked (but not item_activated). This aligns ItemList with other GUI controls, ensuring keyboard and screen-reader users can still navigate to and read disabled options.\r\n\r\nLet me know if this looks good or if any further discussion is needed. Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4754034494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]